WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.869
We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.869 --> 00:00:05.171
Now, if you don't mind,
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.307
After New York Congressman
George Santos

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:09.709
was expelled from the House
of Representatives last week,

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.544
Santos told reporters, quote,

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:14.881
"to hell with this place"
and left in a black SUV.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:20.286
Ah, yes, the official exit
of hot messes everywhere.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.955
That's the same way Andy Dick
left every restaurant

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:25.725
for six years.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.760
That's right. George Santos was
expelled last week

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.728
from the House, and the sign
in front of his office

00:00:29.728 --> 00:00:30.897
was taken down.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:35.501
No clue why it was up
in the first place.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:38.004
In her new book, former
Wyoming Congresswoman Liz Cheney

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.972
writes that Republican
Representative Mark Green

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.442
referred to former
President Trump as, quote,

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:46.145
"Orange Jesus." What?
Orange Jesus?

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.747
The only way Trump is like
Jesus

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:51.551
is that both got other people
to write their books for them.

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.125
Cheney also writes
that former President Trump

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.594
was so depressed
after losing the 2020 election

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:02.795
that he stopped eating,

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:05.064
unless you count the thousands
and thousands

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.300
of classified documents.

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:13.005
"I'll be --
I'll be right there."

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:17.176
"We have a warrant."
"Oh, then come in."

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:18.477
President Biden over
the weekend

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:19.946
hosted Kennedy Center honorees,

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.114
including actor Billy Crystal
and Queen Latifah.

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.751
Hey, get out of there!

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:28.187
Damn it, George!

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:32.358
A deer in Maine recently crashed
through the window of a TJ Maxx.

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:33.793
But the manager
was actually happy

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.796
because now there's a reason
the store looks like that.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.870
The streaming service
Spotify announced today

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:45.505
that it will cut 1,500 jobs.

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.306
Even worse, they notified
the employees

00:01:47.306 --> 00:01:49.409
through their Spotify Wrapped.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.349
And finally, the University
of Minnesota has announced

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:59.352
it will launch a new cannabis
research center or,

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:00.687
as they're more
commonly known,

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:03.055
dorms.

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:06.059
That was a monologue, everybody.
We're up and running.

